e extra edge needed to survive the apocalypse<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923280/extras/0028aae390bd6480f2880807bdda7145.poster.avif?t=1734094171\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923280/extras/0028aae390bd6480f2880807bdda7145.webm?t=1734094171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>And make sure to paint your ride in your favorite color to feel amazing whilst crushing your opponents in the all-out warfare of tomorrow!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923280/extras/6e3b314b8ebc597a78c7595e99429cc2.avif?t=1734094171\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><br>You wake up to the rumble of car engines, disoriented and without any memories on how you ended up in this car.<br><br>You do know that winning the race you apparently are in is your only hope to figure out where you are and how to get your memories back.<br><br>Survive the CARnage using weapons and the environment to your advantage!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923280/extras/30420822f9802d5d099068c9a412f1b2.poster.avif?t=1734094171\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923280/extras/30420822f9802d5d099068c9a412f1b2.webm?t=1734094171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923280/extras/30420822f9802d5d099068c9a412f1b2.mp4?t=1734094171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And make sure to stay away from the horrors that your opponents and tracks throw at you...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img